    <ShortLegislativeSummaryEn>&lt;div&gt;The Library of Parliament does not prepare Legislative Summaries for self-explanatory measures. The following is a short summary:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;On 20 March 2019, the Minister of Finance introduced Bill C-94, An Act respecting certain payments to be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund, in the House of Commons and it was given first reading.   &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Bill C-94 authorizes payments to be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund in relation to infrastructure as well as to the Federation of Canadian Municipalities and to the Shock Trauma Air Rescue Service.&lt;/div&gt;</ShortLegislativeSummaryEn>
    <ShortLegislativeSummaryFr>&lt;div&gt;La Bibliothèque du Parlement ne prépare pas de Résumés législatifs pour les mesures qui sont suffisamment explicites. Ce qui suit est un court résumé :&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Le 20 mars 2019, le Ministre des Finances a déposé le projet de loi C-94, Loi visant certains paiements sur le Trésor à la Chambre des communes en première lecture.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Le projet de loi C-94 autorise des paiements sur le Trésor en matière d'infrastructures ainsi qu'à la Fédération canadienne des municipalités et au Shock Trauma Air Rescue Service.&lt;/div&gt;</ShortLegislativeSummaryFr>
    <ShortLegislativeSummary>&lt;div&gt;The Library of Parliament does not prepare Legislative Summaries for self-explanatory measures. The following is a short summary:&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;On 20 March 2019, the Minister of Finance introduced Bill C-94, An Act respecting certain payments to be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund, in the House of Commons and it was given first reading.   &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Bill C-94 authorizes payments to be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund in relation to infrastructure as well as to the Federation of Canadian Municipalities and to the Shock Trauma Air Rescue Service.&lt;/div&gt;</ShortLegislativeSummary>
